# Plugin config — local copy with operator credentials, gitignored to avoid
# committing API keys. Each developer copies plugins/config.example.json over
# this file and edits with their own keys. The PluginLoader falls back to
# auto-loading built-ins with defaults when this file is missing.
src/Famick.HomeManagement.Web/plugins/config.json

# Server-level overlay written by the first-run wizard and the admin
# "Server Settings" page (SMTP creds, JWT issuer/audience, public host name,
# plugins path). The [Cc] glob covers macOS case-insensitive filesystems
# where the folder may exist as "Config/" from the legacy appsettings overlay.
src/Famick.HomeManagement.Web/[Cc]onfig/server-config.json

# Per-developer dev-only overlay — everything in here is gitignored except the
# README. appsettings.Development.json points the Plugins:Path and
# ServerConfig:Path settings here so the wizard / admin pages write into this
# folder instead of the project tree when running `dotnet run`. See
# local_config/README.md for setup.
local_config/*
!local_config/README.md
